Package: divpatterns
Title: Observed Patterns of Protein Evolutionary Divergence
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Julian", "Echave", , "jechave@unsam.edu.ar", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0678-5593"))
Description: Calculates observed patterns of divergence for real
    homologous proteins, given their structures and a sequence alignment.
    These are the patterns to which simulated evolution models are fitted
    and compared.
